r-output .infobox-table>tbody{display:table-row-group}body.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox-table th,body.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox-table td{padding-left:inherit;padding-right:inherit}}</style><table class=\"infobox hrecipe adr\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-above\">太妃糖</th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-image\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Thorntonstoffee.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f3/Thorntonstoffee.jpg/250px-Thorntonstoffee.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"167\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f3/Thorntonstoffee.jpg/500px-Thorntonstoffee.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"4368\" data-file-height=\"2912\" /></a></span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"padding-top:0.245em;line-height:1.15em; padding-right:0.65em; white-space:nowrap;;\">類型</th><td class=\"infobox-data\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%B3%96%E6%9E%9C\" title=\"糖果\">糖果</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"padding-top:0.245em;line-height:1.15em; padding-right:0.65em; white-space:nowrap;;\">上菜順序</th><td class=\"infobox-data\" style=\"\">甜點</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"padding-top:0.245em;line-height:1.15em; padding-right:0.65em; white-space:nowrap;;\">起源地</th><td class=\"infobox-data region\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8B%B1%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%B0\" title=\"英格蘭\">英格蘭</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"padding-top:0.245em;line-height:1.15em; padding-right:0.65em; white-space:nowrap;;\">主要成分</th><td class=\"infobox-data ingredient\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%94%97%E7%B3%96\" title=\"蔗糖\">蔗糖</a>或<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%B3%96%E8%9C%9C\" title=\"糖蜜\">糖蜜</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/%E9%BB%84%E6%B2%B9\" title=\"奶油\">奶油</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"padding-top:0.245em;line-height:1.15em; padding-right:0.65em; white-space:nowrap;;\">菜品變種</th><td class=\"infobox-data\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%A4%AA%E7%B3%96\" title=\"椪糖\">椪糖</a></td></tr></tbody></table><figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Heath-broken.JPG\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5b/Heath-broken.JPG/250px-Heath-broken.JPG?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5b/Heath-broken.JPG/500px-Heath-broken.JPG?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"3860\" data-file-height=\"1140\" /></a><figcaption><i>Heath</i> <i>bar</i>，為外層包裹牛奶巧克力的英式太妃糖製品。</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>太妃糖</b>（英語：<span lang=\"en\">Toffee</span>，<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF\" title=\"香港\">香港</a><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%9F%B3%E8%AD%AF\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"音譯\">音譯</a>為<b>拖肥</b>，<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%AD%E8%8F%AF%E6%B0%91%E5%9C%8B%E5%9C%8B%E8%AA%9E\" title=\"中華民國國語\">國語</a>音譯為<b>太妃</b>）是一種英式糖果，通過將<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%94%97%E7%B3%96\" title=\"蔗糖\">蔗糖</a>或<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%B3%96%E8%9C%9C\" title=\"糖蜜\">糖蜜</a>與奶油加熱<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BE%8E%E6%8B%89%E5%BE%B7%E5%8F%8D%E5%BA%94\" title=\"美拉德反應\">焦糖化</a>製成。其製作過程包含將原料持續加熱至<span class=\"ilh-all\" data-orig-title=\"硬裂纹阶段\" data-lang-code=\"en\" data-lang-name=\"英语\" data-foreign-title=\"Candy&#95;making#Sugar&#95;stages\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E7%A1%AC%E8%A3%82%E7%BA%B9%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"硬裂紋階段（頁面不存在）\">硬裂紋階段</a></span><span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\"><span class=\"ilh-paren\">（</span><span class=\"ilh-lang\">英語</span><span class=\"ilh-colon\">：</span><span class=\"ilh-link\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Candy_making#Sugar_stages\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Candy making\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"auto\">Candy_making#Sugar_stages</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span>（149–154 °C / 300–310 °F），此時糖漿冷卻後呈現硬脆特徵。部分配方會添加少量麵粉調節質地，或混入<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%9D%9A%E6%9E%9C\" title=\"堅果\">堅果</a>碎粒、<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%91%A1%E8%90%84%E4%B9%BE\" title=\"葡萄乾\">葡萄乾</a>等輔料以豐富口感層次。糖蜜在高溫下產生的<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%BD%89%E5%8C%96%E7%B3%96%E6%BC%BF\" title=\"轉化糖漿\">轉化糖</a>成分有助於改善成品的保濕性與結晶結構。\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"变体与应用\"><span id=\".E5.8F.98.E4.BD.93.E4.B8.8E.E5.BA.94.E7.94.A8\"></span>變體與應用</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E5%A4%AA%E5%A6%83%E7%B3%96&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節：變體與應用\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>在美國，一種受歡迎的變體是<b>英式太妃糖</b>（English toffee），這是一種奶油含量較高的太妃糖，通常加入杏仁製成。該產品根據質地可分為耐嚼型和硬質型兩種版本。美國知名糖果品牌\"<span class=\"ilh-all\" data-orig-title=\"Heath&#95;bar\" data-lang-code=\"en\" data-lang-name=\"英语\" data-foreign-title=\"Heath&#95;bar\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Heath_bar&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Heath bar（頁面不存在）\">Heath bar</a></span><span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\"><span class=\"ilh-paren\">（</span><span class=\"ilh-lang\">英語</span><span class=\"ilh-colon\">：</span><span class=\"ilh-link\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heath_bar\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Heath bar\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"auto\">Heath_bar</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span>\"即以英式太妃糖為核心原料製成。儘管冠以\"英式\"之名，其實際特性與英國本土多樣化的太妃糖品類存在顯著差異。不過該產品在英國市場以\"奶油脆糖\"（butter crunch）的名稱流通。<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Hughes&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Hughes-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"词源考据\"><span id=\".E8.AF.8D.E6.BA.90.E8.80.83.E6.8D.AE\"></span>詞源考據</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E5%A4%AA%E5%A6%83%E7%B3%96&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"編輯章節：詞源考據\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>該詞彙起源尚未定論。飲食作家<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%93%88%E6%B4%9B%E5%BE%B7%C2%B7%E9%A9%AC%E5%9F%BA\" title=\"哈洛德·馬基\">哈羅德·馬基</a>主張其源自「<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%85%8B%E9%87%8C%E5%A5%A7%E7%88%BE%E8%AA%9E\" title=\"克里奧爾語\">克里奧爾語</a>中糖與糖蜜混合物的稱謂」，但未明確具體語言分支。<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-McGee&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-McGee-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>據《牛津英語詞典》記載，\"toffee\"作為書面詞彙首現於1825年，系\"taffy\"（1817年首次記錄）的方言變體，這兩個詞彙最初均以英格蘭方言形式被文獻記載。<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>值得注意的是，該詞與<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%98%BF%E5%9D%8E%E8%AF%AD\" title=\"阿坎語\">阿坎語</a>中的\"tafere\"存在詞形相似性，後者可直譯為\"舔（手指）\"的動作描述。\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"参见\"><span id=\".E5.8F.82.E8.A7.81\"></span>參見</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E5%A4%AA%E5%A6%83%E7%B3%96&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"編輯章節：參見\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r79074265\">.mw-parser-output .div-col{margin-top:0.3em;column-width:30em}.mw-parser-output .div-col-small{font-size:90%}.mw-parser-output .div-col-rules{column-rule:1px solid #aaa}.mw-parser-output .div-col dl,.mw-parser-output .div-col ol,.mw-parser-output .div-col ul{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .div-col li,.mw-parser-output .div-col dd{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}.mw-parser-output .plainlist ol,.mw-parser-output .plainlist ul{line-height:inherit;list-style:none;margin:0}.mw-parser-output .plainlist ol li,.mw-parser-output .plainlist ul li{margin-bottom:0}</style><div class=\"div-col\" style=\"column-width:20em;\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%A8%82%E5%AE%B6%E6%9D%8F%E4%BB%81%E7%B3%96\" title=\"樂家杏仁糖\">樂家杏仁糖</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%84%A6%E7%B3%96\" title=\"焦糖\">焦糖</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%84%A6%E7%B3%96%E7%89%9B%E5%A5%B6%E9%86%AC\" title=\"焦糖牛奶醬\">焦糖牛奶醬</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B9%B3%E8%84%82%E8%BB%9F%E7%B3%96\" title=\"乳脂軟糖\">乳脂軟糖</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8A%B1%E7%94%9F%E7%B3%96\" title=\"花生糖\">花生糖</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r82655521\">.mw-parser-output .side-box{margin:4px 0;box-sizing:border-box;border:1px solid #aaa;font-size:88%;line-height:1.25em;background-color:#f9f9f9;display:flow-root}.mw-parser-output .side-box-abovebelow,.mw-parser-output .side-box-text{padding:0.25em 0.9em}.mw-parser-output .side-box-image{padding:2px 0 2px 0.9em;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .side-box-imageright{padding:2px 0.9em 2px 0;text-align:center}@media(min-width:500px){.mw-parser-output .side-box-flex{display:flex;align-items:center}.mw-parser-output .side-box-text{flex:1}}@media(min-width:720px){.mw-parser-output .side-box{width:238px}.mw-parser-output .side-box-right{clear:right;float:right;margin-left:1em}.mw-parser-output .side-box-left{margin-right:1em}}</style><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r88912232\">@media print{body.ns-0 .mw-parser-output .sistersitebox{display:none!important}}</style><div class=\"side-box side-box-right plai